# Energy cutoff for the dielectric matrix (Ry)
epsilon_cutoff 10.0

# Total number of bands (occupied + unoccupied) used in the summation
number_bands 32

# q-points in crystal coordinates: qx qy qz 1/scale_factor is_q0
# The q-grid must be commensurate with the k-grid of WFN; the first q-point is the
# small q0 shift (matching the WFNq k-grid offset) and is flagged with is_q0 = 1.
begin qpoints
  0.000000000  0.000000000  0.001000000  1.0  1
  0.000000000  0.000000000  0.250000000  1.0  0
  0.000000000  0.000000000  0.500000000  1.0  0
  0.000000000  0.250000000  0.250000000  1.0  0
  0.000000000  0.250000000  0.500000000  1.0  0
  0.000000000  0.250000000  0.750000000  1.0  0
  0.000000000  0.500000000  0.500000000  1.0  0
  0.250000000  0.500000000  0.750000000  1.0  0
end
